        <p>I won't waste your time. Here's the short version. Last year my private group of 47 retail traders closed the year with an average account growth of <span class="hl">+247%</span>. That number is real. I have the broker statements. I'm not selling you a course. I'm not selling you a book. I run a small WhatsApp room out of a coworking space on King Street West and I post setups three to five mornings a week.</p>

        <p>I'm writing this letter today because I just opened up <strong>12 seats</strong> in the room. The last batch closed in 9 hours. I expect this one to close faster. So before you scroll past, do me one favour &mdash; read the next 2 minutes. If by the end you think this isn't for you, close the tab. No hard feelings.</p>

        <p>But if you've ever sat on the sidelines while a stock you were watching ran 80% in an afternoon, this letter is the one I wish someone had sent me at 47.</p>
