              <p>The first thing I told him was: <strong>don&rsquo;t trade for two weeks. Just watch.</strong> He did. On day 16 he took his first setup &mdash; three contracts on [Setup #1], the one I&rsquo;d posted at 9:31 AM. He closed by 2 PM the same day for <span class="pnl">+$1,240</span>.</p>
              <p>Three weeks later his account was up <span class="pnl">+$18,400</span>. Not because he&rsquo;s smart. Because he showed up at 9:30 AM, took the setups I posted, and didn&rsquo;t argue with the stop-loss.</p>
